是独立开发者还是创业团队，只要产品已经有可体验的形态，都欢迎自荐。\n\n🙋带着产品来打个招呼吧！\n\n只需要发布产品介绍并@科技编辑 ，我们将会认真讨论审查。\n\n我们也会主动寻找和邀请有意思的产品，遇到好产品就去敲敲创造者的门！\n\n⚠️提交不代表一定入选，入选后会由编辑联系沟通。\n\n“All that matters is that you are making something you love, to the best of your ability, here and now.”\n\n期待真问题，期待好产品，期待创造者自豪宣介。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/users/jikekeji01"},"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af7f2110ee16426611cf4c6","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"下雨的水面 好像满天的星辰","body":"下雨的水面\n\n好像满天的星辰","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af7f2110ee16426611cf4c6","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FsrPcI8DYnHd7i-B10PoyFzNn8Jrv3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:30:57+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:09:40+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FsrPcI8DYnHd7i-B10PoyFzNn8Jrv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af79db3136b2761c64ca316","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"昨天给 grokbot 升级到了新的套餐 然后把 Codex 退订到更低一档 前者模型能力未必更好 但很多业务工作流跑在了上面 折腾一下成本挺高 而 Codex 主要写代码 很容易替换 一个奇妙的体感，记一下","body":"昨天给 grokbot 升级到了新的套餐\n\n然后把 Codex 退订到更低一档\n\n前者模型能力未必更好\n\n但很多业务工作流跑在了上面\n\n折腾一下成本挺高\n\n而 Codex 主要写代码\n\n很容易替换\n\n一个奇妙的体感，记一下","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af7